Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Retro Handheld: MPRIS on the session bus

org.mpris.MediaPlayer2.rockbox: playback status, the track (title, artist,
album, length), play, pause, stop, next, previous, for the system's media
controls. The D-Bus connection is SenkOS' own (apps/senkos-bus, copied in at
build time), no libdbus.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [uses SenkOS' own D-Bus code, not libdbus]
